  "_verdict_rule": "A derived ns/day may only be used if its leave-one-out error is small enough that a mis-ranking is impossible at the price spreads on the board. The board's best and worst gradeable offers differ by ~4x in $/ns, so an error above ~15-20% can invert a ranking and the route is dead."
 }
